abstract: >-
  WebChess is a rule-governed deliberative layer for foundation models. It
  combines structured 64-facet problem construction, reproducible symbolic
  casting, circular chess traversal, Portia adversarial prompt examination,
  deterministic sufficiency gating, bounded retry, Charlotte qualification,
  human-owned Wilbur actions, and durable provenance.
